exports[`output of every command, text and --json > take a new issue > text 1`] = `
"exit 0
You now hold issue #7 "Rate limiting". Its step is triage. This step is
attended: the user takes part, and you do not decide on your own.

Invoke the skill: norn-triage
Read the issue: gh issue view 7 --comments
Unless you reject it, post what triage established on the issue first: gh issue comment 7

When the user agrees triage is finished, run one of:
  norn done 7 story             (a story: moves to refinement)
  norn done 7 reject "reason"   (closed as not planned; give the reason)

On a long step, run norn take 7 again now and then: it keeps your claim fresh.
If you have to stop, run: norn release 7
If something is wrong and a person is needed, run: norn escalate 7 "reason"

Do not change labels yourself. Only norn changes them."
`;

