  norn done 61 pass "evidence" [--evidence <dir>]   (every criterion you could check passed; moves on to QA by a person)
  norn done 61 fail "evidence" [--evidence <dir>]   (put the failures with their repros in the note)

On a long step, run norn take 61 again now and then: it keeps your claim fresh.
If you have to stop, run: norn release 61
If something is wrong and a person is needed, run: norn escalate 61 "reason"

Do not change labels yourself. Only norn changes them."
`;

